{"name":"Icing on the Cake","hex":"#f8c4c5","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"icing on the cake","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thing which intensifies the appreciation of something already good, or  the regretting of something already bad."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/icing_on_the_cake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Icing on the Cake","blocks":[{"text":"\"Icing on the Cake\" is the 17th episode from the dramedy series Ugly Betty, which aired March 15, 2007. The episode was written by Dailyn Rodriguez and directed by Jeff Melman."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/fd/UB_S01E17_Snap.png/330px-UB_S01E17_Snap.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icing_on_the_Cake","wikidata":"Q16744255"},{"title":"Icing (food)","blocks":[{"text":"Icing is a sweet glaze, made of sugar with a liquid, such as water or milk, that is often enriched with ingredients like butter, eggwhites, cream cheese, or flavorings. It is used to coat or decorate baked goods, such as cakes, donuts, or honey buns. When it is used between layers of cake, it is known as a filling in some foods."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Lemon_bundt_cake_%282%29%2C_January_2010.jpg/330px-Lemon_bundt_cake_%282%29%2C_January_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icing_(food)","wikidata":"Q29437"},{"title":"Cake","blocks":[{"text":"Cake is a baker's confectionery made by combining flour with a liquid, a fat or both, and usually with a leavening agent. Cakes are usually baked, but can be griddled. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of bread, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate and which share features with other desserts such as pastries, meringues, custards, and pies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.o